    {
      "id": "claim_4c74007e64c94dff9f71094fd1ce43a2",
      "statement": "stream(input, config, *, stop, **kwargs) → Iterator[AIMessageChunk] yields streaming chunks by calling _stream() (or falls back to invoke() if not implemented), dispatches on_llm_new_token() callbacks per chunk, attaches run IDs and response_metadata, and fires on_llm_end()/on_llm_error() lifecycle events.",
