    {
      "id": "claim_dd2c29d7fb1e4ac3b5e0eaeace1def11",
      "statement": "_generate_with_cache() implements the generation lifecycle: checks cache via _get_llm_string() serialization, returns cached ChatGenerations on hit with replayed V2 events, applies rate_limiter.acquire() on miss, branches to V2 event streaming if _should_use_protocol_streaming(), falls back to _stream() if V1 streaming, or calls _generate()/_agenerate() directly; adds response_metadata and manages output_version='v1' content block transformation.",
