      "id": "claim_96d2c3636b3041f69825dcdeccc8b19a",
      "statement": "bind_tools(tools: Sequence[...], tool_choice=None, **kwargs) → Runnable is a method that raises NotImplementedError in base class, intended for override by provider implementations to convert tool schemas (BaseTool, Pydantic, functions, dicts) to provider format and encode into API calls.",
